Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:18.00,0:00:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,SETTING UP THE PROJECT
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:21.50,0:00:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,First you need to install the SDK.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:25.50,0:00:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Download it from the official website.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.50,0:00:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Run the installer and follow the prompts.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:41.00,0:00:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,WRITING THE CODE
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.50,0:00:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Open your editor and create a new file.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:48.50,0:00:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Start by writing the main function.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:52.50,0:00:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Add your logic inside the function body.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.00,0:01:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,RUNNING AND TESTING
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.50,0:01:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Save your file and open a terminal.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.50,0:01:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Run the dotnet build command.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.50,0:01:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then run dotnet test to verify.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:19.50,0:01:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All tests should pass successfully.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:23.50,0:01:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for watching this tutorial.
